d to account for unequal probability of selection and nonresponse\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The p-values for all chi-squared tests were <0.001 and are not presented.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"the total estimated number of cases of acute hepatitis C for 2018 was calculated using standard methodology\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"no stratifications of interest met National Center for Health Statistics data presentation standards because of small cell counts\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}